  "description": "T1. Holm Oak\t\r\nRear Garden:\r\nVery suppressed and misshapen due to the previous tree.\r\nReduce the height by 3.5m and reduce the lateral spread by 1m to balance, with an emphasis on branches overhanging the garden of 74, to go as close to the fence line as reasonably possible without compromising the overall shape.\r\nRemove dead branches over 2.5cm in diameter.\r\nThe tree's current height is 8m, and its crown spread is 3m.\r\nAfter the proposed works, the tree's height is 5m and the crown spread is 2m (not radial).\r\n\r\nT2. Holm Oak\t\r\nRear Garden:\r\nReduce height by 2m and spread by 1.5m to a natural rounded form with an emphasis on branches that are overhanging the garden of 74 to go as close to the fence line as reasonably possible without compromising the overall shape. Remove dead branches over 2.5cm in diameter.\r\nThe tree's current height is 9m, and its crown spread is 4m.\r\nAfter the proposed works, the tree's height is 7m and the crown spread is 2.5m (not radial).",
